{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 Life Wrapped - App Review Guide\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Version:} 1.3\line {\b Date:} September 28, 2026\line {\b Developer:} Jose Ramirez-Villa\line {\b Contact:} jsayram@Gmail.com\par}
{\pard \qc \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Quick Overview\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Life Wrapped} is a privacy-first audio journaling app that records voice memos, transcribes them on-device, and provides AI-powered summaries and insights.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Key Differentiator:} All transcription happens on the device using Apple\u8217's Speech framework. Audio never leaves the device, and journal text leaves it only if the user sets up the optional Cloud AI feature with their own API key.\par}
{\pard \qc \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 No Sign-In Required\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 This app does {\b not require user authentication}. Users can immediately start recording and using all core features without creating an account.\par}
{\pard \qc \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Core Features to Test\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 1. Recording Audio\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Tap the {\b microphone button} to start recording\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Tap again to stop\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Recordings are automatically chunked for efficient processing\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 2. On-Device Transcription\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab After recording, transcription begins automatically\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Uses Apple Speech framework with {\f1 requiresOnDeviceRecognition = true}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b No internet required} for transcription\sa180\par}
