\intbl\row}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 The processing task finishes the summaries of months that have ended, so the Year Wrap has finished months to read. The app schedules it when it goes to the background. It asks iOS to run it only while the device is on external power ({\f1 requiresExternalPower = true}), no sooner than 30 minutes later, and it doesn\u8217't require a network connection. It uses the summary engine the user chose, so with Key Sentences, Offline AI or Apple Intelligence it runs entirely on the device. It is the same work the app already does in the foreground when it opens. If the user chose Cloud AI, the month\u8217's text goes to their provider, as described in the privacy policy. iOS decides when the task runs, and it stops when iOS ends the task.\par}
{\pard \qc \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\par}
