{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 These features are optional and only work if the user chooses to enable them:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Cloud AI (Bring Your Own Key)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Unlocked with a one-time, non-consumable in-app purchase ($2.99, product ID {\f1 com.jsayram.lifewrapped.smartestai}). There is no subscription\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Users then add their own OpenAI or Anthropic API key; keys are stored in the iOS Keychain\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab This is the {\b only feature} that sends journal text to external servers, and only to the provider the user connects\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Users must explicitly configure this in Settings, then AI & Summaries\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Offline AI Model Download\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Users can download an AI model (~2.3 GB, or ~1.0 GB on 4 GB devices) for on-device summaries\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab One-time download from Hugging Face; no journal data is sent\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab After download, works completely offline\sa180\par}
