{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Privacy Highlights\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab \u9989 ? {\b No tracking or analytics}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab \u9989 ? {\b No third-party analytics or ad SDKs.} The only third-party libraries are MLX and Hugging Face swift-transformers, which run the optional Offline AI model on the device\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab \u9989 ? {\b No data collection} \u8212- we don\u8217't have servers\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab \u9989 ? {\b All data stored locally} in a SQLite database protected by iOS file protection\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab \u9989 ? {\b Speech Recognition} uses {\f1 requiresOnDeviceRecognition = true}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab \u9989 ? {\b Users can export and delete all data} anytime\sa180\par}
